+
+**A record whose decisive argument inverts its own mechanism.** ADR-049's
+security rationale rests on `MERGEABLE_KEYS` preventing a cloned-repo
+`personal.autonomy` escalation. `_filter_whitelist` runs on the user-global
+layer only (`agent_settings.ts:860`); the project cascade merges unfiltered,
